    ] },
    { "t": "h", "x": "How to learn them" },
    { "t": "list", "items": [
      "Ten at a time. Drill, then move on; the **Practice** tab mixes in everything you have done.",
      "Rows that look odd (*the* on a bare `-T`) are on purpose: the commonest words get the cheapest keys.",
      "Stuck on a word? **Lookup** shows its fastest outline and the other ways in.",
      "Each of these also has joins and extras. You will never need them for a word you have memorised."
    ] },
